OL,3,GNEWSANew website tracks promises made
OL,4,Aby deputies
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new website has been launched to
OL,7,Fhighlight Guernsey States members'
OL,8,Fmanifestos against their public voting
OL,9,Frecords.
OL,11,FThe Guernsey Deputy Scorecard tracked a
OL,12,Fvariety of data, including deputies'
OL,13,Fvotes, their committee and States
OL,14,Fmeeting attendance, and how many words
OL,15,Fthey spoke in the States Chamber,
OL,16,Fcreator William Walter said.
OL,18,FThe website did not take into
OL,19,Fconsideration committee-level
OL,20,Fcontributions, since it only measured
OL,21,Fwhat was on public record, he added.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
