OL,3,GNEWSANew website tracks promises made
OL,4,Aby deputies
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe rankings worked using a points
OL,7,Fsystem, with deputies earning credit
OL,8,Ffor voting consistently with previous
OL,9,Fpromises in manifestos, and deputies
OL,10,Fcould also attach responses and
OL,11,Fexplanation alongside any verdicts,
OL,12,FWalter said.
